abstract: >-
  A structural framework on AI alignment, specification coherence, separable objective
  specification, substrate-aware optimization, valence-aware optimization, and the
  Stability Assumption. Current proof status: Stage 4 — candidate proof architecture
  under named premises, without independent specialist verification and without theorem
  closure.
